[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0010","text":"怎么还不快点开始啊！\n我都等不及啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0020","text":"哈哈，你脸上写着“好想动起来”呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0030","text":"没错！\n终于能站上舞台了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0040","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0050","text":"像老鼠吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0060","text":"啊哈哈\n是这样吗！　乌鸦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0070","text":"舞台之上，是朝日的自由"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0080","text":"朝日什么都能变成\n什么都能做到──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0090","text":"尽情地去大干一场吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_03_0100","text":"好！\n要好好看着我哦，制作人！"}]
